\newlabel{tab:compute-bound-prf}{{VI}{9}{Nonzero compute-bound precision/recall/F1 on the 732-sample shared subset. These metrics complement the balanced-accuracy headline by exposing whether a method reaches high recall by over-predicting the compute-bound side. A dash marks an undefined value: when a model predicts no compute-bound kernels for a precision (as every model does for \sourceonly FP16), recall is $0$ and precision/F1 have a zero denominator}{table.6}{}}
